  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Butterfly cupcakes bring a burst of whimsy to your kitchen, like little edible butterflies ready to brighten any day. Soft vanilla cupcakes are topped with fluffy buttercream in pastel shades, then finished with delicate wafer wings that make each treat feel extra magical. With simple steps and everyday ingredients, you can bake moist cupcakes and decorate them beautifully without special tools. Perfect for garden parties or sweet surprises, these charming cupcakes turn baking into a fun, memory making celebration.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-butterfly-cupcakes\">Why You’ll Love This butterfly cupcakes</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-butterfly-cupcakes\">How to Make Butterfly Cupcakes</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-butterfly-cupcakes\">Pro Tips for Making Butterfly Cupcakes</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-butterfly-cupcakes\">How to Serve this butterfly cupcakes</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-butterfly-cupcakes\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This butterfly cupcakes</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Delightfully whimsical and perfect for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to customize with your favorite flavors and toppings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fun and interactive decorating process for all ages.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Light and fluffy texture that melts in your mouth.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-11408\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"11408\" data-servings=\"12\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meado